flowchart TD
    A([Start / Telemetry]) --> B[Monitor Agent\nmetrics + logs]
    B --> C[Diagnostician Agent\nRAG knowledge base]
    C --> D[Remediation Agent\nsafety gate + simulated fix]
    D --> E[Verify\nread-only health check]
    E -->|Pass| F([Complete])
    E -->|Fail and attempts remain| G[Set retry = true]
    G --> C
    E -->|Retry limit reached| H([Escalate / unresolved])
